WEBVTT

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:43.450
"Episode 24"
"Freed Sky_Joined Hands"

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.290
I'm going to set the Divine Beast free!

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:04.790
Everything the foolish do is meaningless!

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.750
How can the Divine Beast be stopped?!

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:22.370
There <i>is</i> no way to stop it!

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:24.250
I'll just force you to tell me!

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.290
The Divine Beast will wipe out civilization.

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:38.910
Complete and indiscriminate destruction.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:41.620
Reduced to almost nothing,

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:45.290
the world will naturally be rebuilt
according to the will of the fairies.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:48.080
That was supposed to be the order's plan!

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:54.500
How easy it would be, if we could leave
it up to nature for people to change!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:16.410
The Divine Beast won't stop.
Not until it reduces this entire land to dust!

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:19.290
With no survivors?

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:23.750
Wasn't it your task to guide
the people who're left?

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:28.950
Humanity didn't die out after the
ancient kingdom of Tupal fell.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:32.200
Once it fulfills its role,
the Divine Beast will be no more!

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:34.120
There's a limit?

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:37.000
It's not going to reduce
the entire world to dust...

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:41.410
Griff Mercer, you planned to escape alone?

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:42.830
Once things calmed down,

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:46.120
you were going to gather the survivors
and become some sort of king?!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:51.540
A leader is needed! One who is wise,
and never makes mistakes!

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:55.540
You could never possibly
be that so-called leader!

00:03:57.950 --> 00:04:01.250
Even so, the world will be reborn.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:07.370
No one can deny this great achievement
the archbishop and I accomplished!

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:16.790
Sure, there are things that don't end.

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.910
But there are things that <i>should</i> end.

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:25.080
I believe in resolving things.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.290
Wolf...

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.120
Wolf!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:33.290
Free. Aren't you going to keep
struggling in vain, the way you do?

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.330
--What about you?
--Hurry and go!

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:37.910
Right.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.910
Hang on, Marlya!

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:55.370
I can never again... see the ones I love.

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:02.290
These feelings aren't going to end.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:06.580
It's all right if they don't end.

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:08.540
It's all right if I don't forget.

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:22.250
I was protected by the Fairy Weapon?

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.910
Because the Divine Beast is also a fairy?

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:29.620
But even if I can defend against that power,
how can I reach it with an attack?

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:30.830
Marlya!

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.620
Let's send them to safety in the direction
opposite the Divine Beast's path.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:36.660
Okay!

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.250
Ver...

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:47.790
Can you walk?

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.700
I can do it.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.080
Go on.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.790
Use this chance to get away.

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:54.000
Hurry.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:01.250
Don't let go, no matter what.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.540
I won't!

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:03.540
Let's go!

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.750
Okay!

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:09.830
Maybe, with Fairy Weapons?

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:11.790
I think there's a chance.

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:15.290
Besides, I felt it.

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:17.950
The Divine Beast has a will, too.

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:23.700
I heard it too. That voice, like a scream?

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:26.370
The Divine Beast was forced into existence.

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:30.790
Isn't it confused, resentful, and distressed?

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:33.120
In that case, we have to stop it.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.120
I want to set it free.

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:46.080
That direction...

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:48.410
It's heading for the palace, all right.

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:50.120
What should we do?

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:55.830
A fairy is sure to have a fairy organ,
like a human has a heart.

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:59.000
Naturally, the Divine Beast will too.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:02.370
If we can just wound it with a Fairy Weapon...

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:07.580
If it were wounded, my Blood Daughter
could get inside the Divine Beast.

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:10.200
That way, you could get at its fairy organ!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.410
Yes.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.120
Over there! It's Marlya!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:23.000
I see her. There's someone else with her!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.540
Veronica?

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:28.200
They're not running away,
they're chasing the Divine Beast.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:29.450
What for?

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:35.950
I don't know, but it must mean Marlya's
trying to do something about it!

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:39.950
I'll provide support!

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.500
Range, 440!

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:45.700
Perfect!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.830
Looks like that doesn't do a thing.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.950
You got its attention, though!

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.700
Everybody, clear out!

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:04.830
Get going!

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:17.620
We caught up.

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:22.450
Begone.

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:24.000
Die out.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.620
Destroy.

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:29.370
All sorts of voices...?

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:32.000
It's bent on wiping us out!

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.450
Stop it! Please! Don't destroy anymore!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:42.410
Our voices won't reach it!

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:45.580
I'll get close, and wound it
with this Fairy Weapon!

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:46.700
Ver!

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:49.910
If I'm with you, I'm not afraid of anything!

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.950
If I'm with you, I'm sure I can do it!

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:02.120
Yes, let's go!

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:13.660
No!

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.200
Marlya!

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:32.200
Oh no! Without a Fairy Weapon...!

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:42.580
Ver!

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:58.450
It's too risky!

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:15.080
I'll be the one to save Marlya!

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:26.950
Ver!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.790
Ver!

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:42.540
Ver! Ver!

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:53.910
Ver!

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:06.120
Ver... Ver!

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:08.450
Speak to me, Ver!

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:11.620
Marlya...

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:12.830
Ver!

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.540
Ver...

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:17.410
Marlya...

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:20.540
You know... I...

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:21.910
What?

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:27.120
I've done a lot... of bad things.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:31.080
I wanted to... atone.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:33.870
To live... and make amends.

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:36.250
But, that's not...!

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:41.330
But, more importantly... If...

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:53.950
If I could... use this life...
for your sake, that would...

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:57.290
My sake?

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:58.540
Marlya...

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.950
Thank you.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:08.540
Ver?

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.290
Don't move around!

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:11.790
Keep still!

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:15.700
I'm begging you!

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:17.290
Marlya.

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:21.330
What?

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:22.540
Live!

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.120
Ver!

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:50.200
Ver! Ver!

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.620
Ver!

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:49.950
Inside me, Blood Daughter...

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:51.620
Let's go, Ver!

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:56.660
To the palace.

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:02.830
Free...! Free!

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:04.040
Marlya!

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:07.120
You're safe!

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.330
Follow the Divine Beast! Hurry!

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:11.330
Right! I'm on it!

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:19.080
Listen, Free...

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:20.660
Ver is...

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:23.330
I see.

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.910
You mean to stop that thing, right?

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:31.620
If we can just wound the
Divine Beast, I can do it.

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:33.370
I'll set it free!

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:35.250
All right!

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:37.160
I'll give it a good slashing!

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:48.370
I believe in you!

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:50.410
Believe in me, too!

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.540
I have, for a long time!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:04.450
It's incredible!

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:05.700
But...!

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:12.830
Cut through it!

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:26.790
Talk about tough!

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:32.500
I'll just have to charge in!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.910
Even if the struggle's useless!

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:50.040
I...

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.540
We...

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:57.580
...won't let it end!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.540
Together!

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:25.750
That fairy!

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.370
Marlya!

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:09.330
Marlya, where are you?!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:11.870
Marlya!

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:15.660
Marlya!

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:19.200
Chima?

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:22.330
You want me to come with you?

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:32.040
Marlya...! Marlya!

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.660
Hey!

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:38.750
Wake up...! Wake up!

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:41.080
Hey, Marlya!

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.290
Marlya!

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.290
Free...

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:49.000
You did it.

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.120
The Divine Beast vanished!

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:57.330
Uh-uh. It was set free, and went
back to the way it should be.

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:06.410
The fairy... The fairies will someday leave us.

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:09.540
There won't be any in this world anymore.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.700
It's not just the fairies.

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:19.450
We've lost so much that can't be replaced.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:22.040
That still doesn't mean it's over.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:26.160
Even those dear to us, who've died...

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:31.830
As long as you or someone
remembers them, they won't fade away.

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:35.950
Even someday when we're gone,

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:41.620
what you've protected might change its
form over time, but it'll still be here.

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:55.660
Isn't the proof that Veronica
lived engraved within you?

00:18:57.120 --> 00:19:01.450
Tell me about her. I want to remember, too.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:05.250
We'll pass it along, so we don't forget.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.660
All right.

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:13.200
There's so much I want to tell you!

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:33.870
Ready to go? We've got to find everyone.

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:35.040
Yes, sir!

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:54.580
"Three months later"

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.660
Many people died during that incident.

00:19:53.660 --> 00:20:04.330
And many left Rondacia after
losing family, friends, and their homes.

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:07.620
People sure are strong, though.

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:11.540
I don't suppose things will soon
be back to how they were before,

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:14.660
but it's being rebuilt a little at a time.

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:20.910
Everyone in Dorothea is working as hard as ever.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:23.160
Axel Laboo!

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:24.330
Dorothea?!

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:29.080
You should think twice, about running.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:30.580
Damn!

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:33.580
You're under arrest for aggravated escape!

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:37.160
Don't try anything, or "bang."

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:45.080
I wonder how Marlya's doing.

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:47.450
So do I.

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:50.660
The director is a cornerstone
of Unified Zesskia,

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:53.500
and Dorothea must give her its firm support.

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:56.540
Please don't push yourself too hard.

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:58.370
Although I'm probably wasting my breath.

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:00.080
Yeah.

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:02.250
Director, it's time for the cabinet meeting.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:03.500
All right.

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:07.950
Are we still no nearer to
choosing a new prime minister?

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:12.290
The military is cozying up to His Imperial
Majesty, and strengthening its influence.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:16.250
They need to be restrained,
but sadly, the right person eludes us.

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:18.870
Why don't <i>you</i> just become prime minister?

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:20.750
That's worth considering.

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:29.200
I'm joking, of course.

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:32.540
She's looking ahead, rather than back.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:34.750
Oh, and as for Damien...

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:41.830
Well, I guess it's a better fit than Dorothea.

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:45.910
Looks like in the end, he found his
calling at the Ministry of Fairies.

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:56.790
But I've been reminded of how people each
have different ways of thinking, and living.

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:06.790
And me? I want to get better at
paying heed to the voices of people.

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:12.450
Both those beloved voices,
and those of people I don't yet know.

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:17.410
She didn't say where she was headed next.

00:22:17.410 --> 00:22:19.540
I'm sure she's doing well.

00:22:21.200 --> 00:22:22.790
I'm sure she is.

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:34.830
The truth is, I wanted Ver and I
to plan together what to do next.

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:41.120
That can't happen now,
but I'm going to live on like I should.

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:45.080
Because Ver will always be here inside me.

00:22:46.750 --> 00:22:50.910
I'm fairy-possessed, but I'm also a human.

00:22:50.910 --> 00:22:54.330
I can listen to the voices of
both fairies and people.

00:22:54.330 --> 00:22:57.870
We'll try as hard as we can not
to lose what's precious to us.

00:22:57.870 --> 00:23:04.450
We might have our doubts, but we'll walk on,
thinking carefully about what's right.

00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:13.750
We'll always be together, Ver.

00:23:13.750 --> 00:23:15.080
I'll come again.

00:23:16.450 --> 00:23:17.700
Are you done?

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:20.200
Yes! Let's go home!

00:23:20.200 --> 00:23:21.410
Yeah.

00:23:26.830 --> 00:23:31.290
The time when fairies aren't
used as weapons still lies ahead.

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:33.540
There are plenty of things we have to do.

00:23:33.540 --> 00:23:35.950
Which means, it's not over yet!

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:37.080
Right!
